    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/c57c32bb232a52b1c43c2086381aed2b.avif?t=1753094598\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an experimental Brain Ball, relying on speed, agility, and smarts to complete your mission\u2026..all while being relentlessly pursued by a horde of hungry zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/2b68a4b5dc10d468c2751a1b3a78cd0e.avif?t=1753094598\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players roll, jump, and maneuver through increasingly dangerous levels while avoiding relentless zombie pursuers. Each swipe from a zombie tears away a piece of the player's brain\u2014lose too many, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, players can collect potions and pickups that boost their abilities. Speed boosts, health potions, and invisibility elixirs offer strategic advantages, helping players slip past patrolling zombies and tackle each challenge with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outrun the Undead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are always on your heels\u2014roll, jump, and dodge your way to safety before they tear your brain apart, piece by piece..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape (mostly/partially) intact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the dungeon as a full brain or as a singular delicious morsel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactable Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger, activate, and manipulate gadgets in the environment to unlock new paths, disable traps, or outsmart the undead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Potion Power-Ups</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect potions for powerful temporary boosts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Health to recover,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Speed Boost to stay ahead,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Invisibility to slip past patrolling zombies unnoticed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with weapon pickups and turn the tables on your brain-hungry pursuers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills and aim for the fastest times\u2014perfect for leaderboard climbers and speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/c57c32bb232a52b1c43c2086381aed2b.avif?t=1753094598\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an experimental Brain Ball, relying on speed, agility, and smarts to complete your mission\u2026..all while being relentlessly pursued by a horde of hungry zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/d8b4e574f6609507653e8aaf42dece30.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/2b68a4b5dc10d468c2751a1b3a78cd0e.avif?t=1753094598\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players roll, jump, and maneuver through increasingly dangerous levels while avoiding relentless zombie pursuers. Each swipe from a zombie tears away a piece of the player's brain\u2014lose too many, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, players can collect potions and pickups that boost their abilities. Speed boosts, health potions, and invisibility elixirs offer strategic advantages, helping players slip past patrolling zombies and tackle each challenge with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/836a9d630bb0884b4c86360c3a909c74.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outrun the Undead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are always on your heels\u2014roll, jump, and dodge your way to safety before they tear your brain apart, piece by piece..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape (mostly/partially) intact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the dungeon as a full brain or as a singular delicious morsel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactable Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger, activate, and manipulate gadgets in the environment to unlock new paths, disable traps, or outsmart the undead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Potion Power-Ups</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect potions for powerful temporary boosts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Health to recover,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Speed Boost to stay ahead,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Invisibility to slip past patrolling zombies unnoticed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with weapon pickups and turn the tables on your brain-hungry pursuers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Trials</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills and aim for the fastest times\u2014perfect for leaderboard climbers and speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.poster.avif?t=1753094598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.webm?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543590/extras/25ca7e6da480bdc807eda1b150e8f21a.mp4?t=1753094598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
